  "sourceTitle": "Where are you running DeepSeek V4.1 Flash reliably? I can't get it to finish a single 2-hour benchmark run",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2e468322e51fe951b6ac297c5b68a431f4aa00316e08687a105f054e326a8714",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-03T12:16:02.362837Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T12:16:30.619056Z",
  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e3ab1a12febea58",
      "translationZh": "我意识到这并不是一个完全可本地托管的模型，至少在我硬件上肯定不是。但我觉得你们中有些人可能对这有所了解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f7cad6c2cd96147",
      "translationZh": "我运行一个 agentic 编码基准测试。模型获得工具（bash、文件编辑、用于试玩的无头浏览器），可以生成子代理，并且有 2 小时来构建一个小型 3D 浏览器游戏。GLM、qwen 等都在 OpenRouter 上使用相同的 harness 运行，并在 27 到 110 之间完成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c14468eb09ec62b",
      "translationZh": "分钟，没有传输错误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8c2ef06571e496f",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 从未完成。在我尝试的所有任务中，它都耗尽了时间。我已经重新启动了赛车游戏运行 4 次，总共约 6+ 小时的墙钟时间，但它每次都达到限制。它很便宜（8.34 美元对应 1,153 次轮次和 143M 输入 token），所以我很想让它工作以进行评估。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79f85c9a4a56658e",
      "translationZh": "设置：`deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash` 在 OpenRouter 上，使用带工具调用的 Chat Completions，max_tokens 32768，默认路由且不进行提供商固定，流式传输并包含使用情况。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5a4f9b785110389",
      "translationZh": "在一小时内两次，OpenRouter 从 Together 发送了 502 provider_unavailable 错误，发生在流式回复途中。一旦流式传输开始，OpenRouter 无法回退到其他提供商，因此该请求就死了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "950dc93c1a14f62a",
      "translationZh": "有 32 条回复返回时既没有文本也没有工具调用。其中 7 条恰好使用了 32,768 个输出 token（大约每条 3.5 分钟）。其余 25 条以不是 stop、length 或 tool_calls 的 finish_reason 结束。其中一条耗时 423 秒，约 10k 输出 token。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f851e2792ce2e75",
      "translationZh": "调用非常慢。在我切换到流式传输之前，两次运行中的 7 个请求触发了我的 600s 客户端超时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f7b998a3fec410e",
      "translationZh": "那么，对于使用 DeepSeek 进行长时间 agentic 会话的人来说，你在哪里运行它？是 DeepSeek 自身的 API（我也在那里没有太多成功）还是类似 OpenRouter 并使用固定提供商的东西？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6635c9b9fec958af",
      "translationZh": "我猜我可以在 runpod 上启动 8xh200 或类似的东西，但这样真的为了 benchmark 某件事而大材小用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fdd3a2e736dc56b",
      "translationZh": "我想，我在此次对话中的总体目标是弄清楚在决定自托管之前，你在哪里对任何大型开源语言模型进行基准测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7a8668c27c01e21",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/sebnadeau 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
